@startuml uml_activity_patient
title Patient Assessment & Explainability Activity Diagram

|Patient|
start
:Open HeartXAI Application;
if (Registered?) then (no)
    :Complete Registration Form;
    :Accept Non-Diagnostic Disclaimer;
    :Account Created;
else (yes)
endif

:Enter Email & Password;
:Login & Obtain Session;

:Navigate to "New Health Assessment";
:Enter Demographics (Age, Sex, Chest Pain);
:Enter Vitals (Resting BP, Max HR, Angina);
:Enter Diagnostics (Chol, FBS, ECG, Fluoroscopy, Thal);
:Submit 13 Biomarkers;

|System Backend|
:Validate Biomarker Ranges & Enums;
if (Valid?) then (no)
    :Return HTTP 422 with Field Errors;
    |Patient|
    :Correct Out-of-Bounds Values;
    |System Backend|
else (yes)
endif

:Preprocess Features via StandardScaler;
:Execute Calibrated XGBoost Model -> CAD Probability;
:Execute ACC/AHA Equations -> 10-Yr ASCVD Risk;
:Compute Exact TreeSHAP Local Attributions;
:Assert Additivity Invariance (|f(x) - (E + sum(phi))| <= 10^-5);
:Persist Assessment, Inference & SHAP Records in DB;
:Log Assessment Event in Audit Trail;

|Patient|
:View Results Dashboard;
:Inspect Dual Risk Dials (CAD % & ASCVD 10-Yr %);
:Inspect TreeSHAP Waterfall Chart & Plain-Language Insights;

fork
    :Open Counterfactual Simulator;
    :Drag Modifiable Sliders (BP, Chol);
    |System Backend|
    :Execute Constrained L1 Solver (Lock Age/Sex);
    :Return Projected Risk Reduction;
    |Patient|
    :Review Feasible Lifestyle Targets;
fork again
    :Explore Personalized Health Guidance;
    :Read Accredited ACC/AHA Guidelines;
fork again
    :Search Local Cardiologists & Hospitals;
    :Grant Time-Bounded Doctor Access;
fork again
    :Download 1-Page Clinical Briefing (PDF/JSON);
end fork

:Save Assessment to Longitudinal History;
stop
@enduml
